  "transition_justification": [
    "Historical v1 is unchanged. Refreshed v2 values come from the merged CardDemo xtask run; changed leaves cite v2 unless the JCL-derived reference matches.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.STATEMNT.HTML: #266: HTML statement record 916 now prints interest TRAN-ID 2022071800000037 from the PARM date.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.STATEMNT.PS: #266: text statement record 174 now prints interest TRAN-ID 2022071800000037 from the PARM date.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.TRANSACT.BKUP.G0002V00: #266: 50 interest TRAN-IDs gain 20220718; matching the 312 records by bytes after the ID shows all payloads unchanged.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.TRANREPT.G0001V00: #287: report record 72 zero amount changed from CP037 4b f0 f0 (.00) to 40 40 40 (spaces) at bytes 110-112; the other 518 records are unchanged. The independent GnuCOBOL report now matches all 519 records.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.TRANSACT.DALY.G0001V00: #266/#267: selected records include dated interest IDs; DCB=(*.SORTIN) now gives FB/350. JCL-derived reference digest matches.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.TRXFL.SEQ: #266: the 350-byte cross-reference records include dated interest TRAN-IDs after the 16-byte card key; record 44 contains 2022071800000037.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.TRANSACT.VSAM.AIX: #266: the alternate index contains the 312 transaction records with the 50 corrected interest IDs; records share the KSDS payload.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.TRXFL.VSAM.KSDS: #266: the cross-reference KSDS contains dated interest TRAN-IDs; record 44 carries 2022071800000037 after its card key.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.TRANSACT.COMBINED.G0001V00: #266: combined transaction records carry the 50 dated interest IDs; the 312 records equal the refreshed backup generation.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.TRANSACT.VSAM.AIX.PATH: #266: the alternate-index PATH reads the same 312 transaction records as the refreshed AIX, including the dated interest IDs.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.SYSTRAN.G0001V00: #266: all 50 generated interest records now start with a 20220718 TRAN-ID; the first is 2022071800000001.",
    "DATASET:AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.TRANSACT.VSAM.KSDS: #266: the transaction KSDS has 50 corrected interest IDs; the first source record is 2022071800000001.",
    "SPOOL:TRANREPT: #266/#277: STEP10R SYSPRINT shows dated interest TRAN-IDs and the literal labels TRAN-AMT and WS-PAGE-TOTAL.",
    "journey_shape_sha256: #287: recomputed from the TRANREPT dataset digest after report record 72 bytes 110-112 changed from CP037 4b f0 f0 (.00) to 40 40 40 (spaces); all other counts, dataset digests, and spool digests are unchanged."
  ],
